## Architecture: Celery Pipeline

We will wire together the full campaign pipeline using Celery tasks + chains: taxonomy generation → hydration → source discovery → scraping → blog generation → SEO publish.
This pipeline is executed as a Celery chord/chain where the tasks process in sequence.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Launch Campaign] --> B[generate_taxonomy_task]
    B --> C[hydrate_campaign_task]
    C --> D[discover_sources_task]
    D --> E[dispatch_campaign_scrapes_task]
    E --> F[publish_campaign_blogs_task]

    B -.->|Error| Z[campaign_pipeline_error_handler]
    C -.->|Error| Z
    D -.->|Error| Z
    E -.->|Error| Z
    F -.->|Error| Z
```

