## Proposed Changes

### Celery Tasks Definition

#### [NEW] [campaign_tasks.py](file:///c:/Users/PC/Documents/HNGi13/legal-watch-dog-be/app/api/modules/v1/campaigns/tasks/campaign_tasks.py)

We will create the tasks required to execute the components of the campaign.

- `generate_taxonomy_task(campaign_id: str)`: Calls `TaxonomyGenerationService.generate()`.
- `hydrate_campaign_task(campaign_id: str)`: Calls `CampaignHydrationService.hydrate()`.
- `discover_sources_task(campaign_id: str)`: Calls `CampaignSourceDiscoveryService.discover_all()`.
- `dispatch_campaign_scrapes_task(campaign_id: str)`: Enqueues scrape jobs for all campaign jurisdictions and updates status to `SCRAPING`.
- `publish_campaign_blogs_task(campaign_id: str)`: Generates and writes blog artifacts for all campaign jurisdictions; triggers `sitemap_rebuild_debounced.delay()`; updates status to `PUBLISHING` then `MONITORING`.
- `campaign_pipeline_error_handler(request, exc, traceback)`: Unified error handling that sets `Campaign.status = FAILED` and logs to `CampaignExecutionLog`.

All tasks will be configured with: `queue="processing", bind=True, max_retries=3, default_retry_delay=60`.
Redis Pub/Sub will be used at the beginning and end of each task to broadcast progress to `campaign_progress:{campaign_id}`.

### Structured Output Contract (Instructor)

#### [MODIFY] [taxonomy_generation_service.py](file:///c:/Users/PC/Documents/HNGi13/legal-watch-dog-be/app/api/modules/v1/campaigns/service/taxonomy_generation_service.py)

Ensure exact schema-constrained parsing is enforced in LLM interaction via the `Instructor` library.
Validation failures will be caught, feedback will be provided for retries (max 2), and if it fails completely, it raises a specific domain error and logs structured validation errors.
Raw LLM response and validated models will both persist for audit purposes.

### Campaign Orchestration Object

#### [NEW] [campaign_orchestration_service.py](file:///c:/Users/PC/Documents/HNGi13/legal-watch-dog-be/app/api/modules/v1/campaigns/service/campaign_orchestration_service.py)
