We will introduce `CampaignOrchestrationService` which implements the [CampaignPipelineRunner](file:///c:/Users/PC/Documents/HNGi13/legal-watch-dog-be/app/api/modules/v1/campaigns/pipelines/base.py#7-88) interface methods:
