- [resume(campaign_id)](file:///c:/Users/PC/Documents/HNGi13/legal-watch-dog-be/app/api/modules/v1/campaigns/pipelines/celery_runner.py#60-70): Relaunches pipeline from the last completed phase.
- [cancel(campaign_id)](file:///c:/Users/PC/Documents/HNGi13/legal-watch-dog-be/app/api/modules/v1/campaigns/pipelines/celery_runner.py#71-81): Status to `CANCELLED` and revokes pending.

Updates to [factory.py](file:///c:/Users/PC/Documents/HNGi13/legal-watch-dog-be/app/api/modules/v1/campaigns/pipelines/factory.py) (and/or deleting [celery_runner.py](file:///c:/Users/PC/Documents/HNGi13/legal-watch-dog-be/app/api/modules/v1/campaigns/pipelines/celery_runner.py)) will ensure [get_pipeline_runner()](file:///c:/Users/PC/Documents/HNGi13/legal-watch-dog-be/app/api/modules/v1/campaigns/pipelines/factory.py#17-56) correctly resolves the orchestration service implementation.

